/* GeoModel3D 深色主题 (7.2 深色底 #1E242C / 面板 #262E38) */
/* 语义色提升亮度一级，保证对比度 >= 4.5:1 */

QWidget {
    color: #E3E9F0;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei UI", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
}

QMainWindow, QDialog, QWizard { background-color: #1E242C; }

QMenuBar {
    background-color: #262E38;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #38424F;
    padding: 2px 4px;
}
QMenuBar::item { background: transparent; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 4px; }
QMenuBar::item:selected { background-color: #33435A; color: #6FA8E0; }

QMenu {
    background-color: #262E38;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px;
}
QMenu::item { padding: 6px 24px 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; }
QMenu::item:selected { background-color: #33435A; color: #6FA8E0; }
QMenu::separator { height: 1px; background: #38424F; margin: 4px 8px; }

QToolBar {
    background-color: #262E38;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #38424F;
    spacing: 4px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
}
QToolBar::separator { width: 1px; background: #38424F; margin: 4px 6px; }
QToolButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    min-height: 22px;
}
QToolButton:hover { background-color: #33435A; border-color: #38424F; }
QToolButton:pressed, QToolButton:checked { background-color: #3B5474; border-color: #6FA8E0; }
QToolButton:disabled { color: #6B7787; }

QDockWidget { titlebar-close-icon: none; titlebar-normal-icon: none; font-weight: 600; }
QDockWidget::title {
    background-color: #2B343F;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #38424F;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    text-align: left;
}

QTabWidget::pane {
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #262E38;
    top: -1px;
}
QTabBar::tab {
    background: #2B343F;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-top-left-radius: 6px;
    border-top-right-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    margin-right: 2px;
    color: #9AA7B4;
}
QTabBar::tab:selected { background: #262E38; color: #6FA8E0; font-weight: 600; }
QTabBar::tab:hover:!selected { background: #33435A; }

QTreeView, QTableView, QListView {
    background-color: #232B34;
    alternate-background-color: #28313B;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 4px;
    selection-background-color: #3B5474;
    selection-color: #FFFFFF;
    outline: none;
}
QTreeView::item, QTableView::item, QListView::item { padding: 3px 4px; }
QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: #2B343F;
    border: none;
    border-right: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #38424F;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

QLineEdit, QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox, QComboBox, QPlainTextEdit, QTextEdit {
    background-color: #232B34;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    selection-background-color: #3B5474;
}
QLineEdit:focus, QSpinBox:focus, QDoubleSpinBox:focus, QComboBox:focus,
QPlainTextEdit:focus, QTextEdit:focus { border: 1px solid #6FA8E0; }
QLineEdit[invalid="true"], QDoubleSpinBox[invalid="true"] { border: 1px solid #E8687A; }

QPushButton {
    background-color: #2B343F;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    min-height: 20px;
}
QPushButton:hover { background-color: #33435A; border-color: #6FA8E0; }
QPushButton:pressed { background-color: #3B5474; }
QPushButton:disabled { color: #6B7787; background: #232B34; }
QPushButton[accent="true"] {
    background-color: #3A7EC6;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #3A7EC6;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QPushButton[accent="true"]:hover { background-color: #4A8ED6; }
QPushButton[accent="true"]:pressed { background-color: #2F6FB5; }
QPushButton[danger="true"] { color: #E8687A; border-color: #7A3B44; }
QPushButton[danger="true"]:hover { background-color: #4A2A30; }

QGroupBox {
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 10px 8px 8px 8px;
    background: #262E38;
    font-weight: 600;
}
QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    subcontrol-position: top left;
    left: 10px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    color: #6FA8E0;
}

QStatusBar {
    background-color: #262E38;
    border-top: 1px solid #38424F;
    color: #9AA7B4;
}
QProgressBar {
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #232B34;
    text-align: center;
    height: 14px;
}
QProgressBar::chunk { background-color: #3FB37A; border-radius: 5px; }

QScrollBar:vertical { background: transparent; width: 10px; margin: 0; }
QScrollBar::handle:vertical { background: #45505E; border-radius: 5px; min-height: 24px; }
QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover { background: #5A6775; }
QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical { height: 0; }
QScrollBar:horizontal { background: transparent; height: 10px; margin: 0; }
QScrollBar::handle:horizontal { background: #45505E; border-radius: 5px; min-width: 24px; }
QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal { width: 0; }

QScrollArea, QAbstractScrollArea { background: transparent; border: none; }
QScrollArea > QWidget > QWidget { background: transparent; }
QScrollArea#parameterPanel, QWidget#parameterContainer {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
}
QAbstractScrollArea::corner { background: transparent; }

QMainWindow::separator { background: #38424F; width: 1px; height: 1px; }

QWidget#viewportOverlay {
    background: rgba(38, 46, 56, 0.88);
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    border-radius: 8px;
}
QToolButton#viewportOverlayButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 4px;
}
QToolButton#viewportOverlayButton:hover { background: #33435A; }
QToolButton#viewportOverlayButton:pressed { background: #3B5474; }

QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    height: 4px;
    background: #45505E;
    border-radius: 2px;
}
QSlider::sub-page:horizontal {
    background: #6FA8E0;
    border-radius: 2px;
}
QSlider::add-page:horizontal {
    background: #45505E;
    border-radius: 2px;
}
QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    background: #E3E9F0;
    border: 1px solid #6FA8E0;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    border-radius: 7px;
}
QSlider::handle:horizontal:hover { background: #D3E3F5; }
QSlider::handle:horizontal:pressed { background: #B8C8DA; }

QComboBox::drop-down { border: none; width: 18px; }
QComboBox QAbstractItemView {
    background: #232B34;
    color: #E3E9F0;
    border: 1px solid #38424F;
    selection-background-color: #3B5474;
    selection-color: #FFFFFF;
    outline: 0;
}

QCheckBox, QRadioButton { spacing: 6px; }
QCheckBox::indicator, QRadioButton::indicator { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
QCheckBox::indicator:unchecked {
    background: #232B34;
    border: 1px solid #45505E;
    border-radius: 3px;
}
QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background: #6FA8E0;
    border: 1px solid #6FA8E0;
    border-radius: 3px;
}
QCheckBox::indicator:disabled { background: #1E242C; border-color: #38424F; }
QRadioButton::indicator:unchecked {
    background: #232B34;
    border: 1px solid #45505E;
    border-radius: 7px;
}
QRadioButton::indicator:checked {
    background: #232B34;
    border: 4px solid #6FA8E0;
    border-radius: 7px;
}

QLineEdit { placeholder-text-color: #6B7787; }
QLineEdit:disabled, QSpinBox:disabled, QDoubleSpinBox:disabled,
QComboBox:disabled, QPlainTextEdit:disabled, QTextEdit:disabled {
    color: #6B7787;
    background: #1E242C;
}
QMenu::item:disabled { color: #6B7787; }

QToolTip {
    background-color: #E3E9F0;
    color: #1E242C;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
}

QLabel[role="title"] { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 600; color: #E3E9F0; }
QLabel[role="hint"] { color: #9AA7B4; font-size: 9pt; }
QLabel[role="danger"] { color: #E8687A; }
QLabel[role="warning"] { color: #F0A75A; }
QLabel[role="success"] { color: #3FB37A; }
